WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Years ago, in the 1920s and the 1930s, they said,

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.120
global cooling will kill the world.

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:08.880
We have to do something.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.400
Then they said global warming will kill the world.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.960
But then it started getting cooler,

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.960
so now they could just call it climate change

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.280
because that way they can't miss.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.879
It's climate change.

00:00:19.879 --> 00:00:22.080
Because if it goes higher or lower,

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.280
whatever the hell happens, it's climate change.

